/* after .circular (display:grid), so a finished circular indicator is hidden too */
.vProgressItem.circular.done{
    display: none;
}
REASON
Grid indicator click-through (pointer-events:none) so content in its space stays usable; .vProgressItem.circular.done hidden, because .circular's display:grid came later than .done's display:none at equal specificity and the overlay never went away.

